------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Optional dictionaries — NOT included in this repository
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The build script also supports the following, which are intentionally NOT
bundled here:

  * 12 pre-modern Arabic dictionaries (al-ʿAyn, Tahdhīb, al-Ṣiḥāḥ, Maqāyīs,
    al-Mukhaṣṣaṣ, al-Mufradāt, Asās al-Balāgha, Mukhtār al-Ṣiḥāḥ, al-Miṣbāḥ,
    al-Qāmūs, Tāj al-ʿArūs, Jamharat al-Lugha) — texts are public domain; the
    digital editions come from the OpenITI corpus (https://openiti.org),
    generally CC BY-SA / CC BY-NC-SA. Fetch them yourself if you want them.

  * Joshua Blau, "A Dictionary of Mediaeval Judaeo-Arabic Texts" (Jerusalem,
    2006) — IN COPYRIGHT. Not distributed. Bring your own copy.

  * Mordechai Akiva Friedman, "A Dictionary of Medieval Judeo-Arabic..."
    (Ben-Zvi Institute, 2016) — IN COPYRIGHT. Not distributed. Bring your own.

See README.md → "Optional dictionaries" for how to add these locally.
